@startuml public-proposal-life-cicle
title Public Proposal Submission Status Life Cycle

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  StartColor #166534
  EndColor #7F1D1D
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #B45309
}

[*] --> FormSubmitted : POST /public/proposals

state "FORM_SUBMITTED\n(not persisted)" as FormSubmitted
state "PENDING_CONFIRMATION\n(persisted)" as Pending
state "CONFIRMED\n(persisted)" as Confirmed
state "INVALID\n(response only)" as Invalid <<transient>>
state "EXPIRED\n(response only)" as Expired <<derived>>
state "ALREADY_CONFIRMED\n(response only)" as AlreadyConfirmed <<derived>>

FormSubmitted --> [*] : honeypot filled\naccept and drop, 202
FormSubmitted --> [*] : schema / rate-limit / captcha failure\n422 / 429 / 403 / 503
FormSubmitted --> Pending : valid form + rate limits ok\ncaptcha valid, token generated

Pending : Aggregate root: PendingPublicSubmission
Pending : status = PENDING_CONFIRMATION
Pending : token is the single-use confirmation handle

Pending --> Invalid : confirm with unknown token
Invalid --> [*] : return 200 INVALID

Pending --> Expired : confirm after token TTL
Expired --> [*] : return 200 EXPIRED\nstored row remains PENDING_CONFIRMATION

Pending --> Confirmed : confirm fresh token\nmaterialise proposal
Confirmed : status = CONFIRMED
Confirmed : confirmed_at is set
Confirmed : proposal_reference is set

Confirmed --> AlreadyConfirmed : confirm same token again
AlreadyConfirmed --> [*] : return 200 ALREADY_CONFIRMED\nwith stored proposal_reference

Confirmed --> [*] : return 200 CONFIRMED\nwith proposal_reference

note right of Pending
  Expiry is not a persisted status.
  The application derives EXPIRED by comparing
  now - created_at with PUBLIC_CONFIRM_TOKEN_TTL_HOURS.
end note

note right of Confirmed
  CONFIRMED is terminal for this context.
  The materialized proposal belongs to Use of Collections;
  Public Submission keeps only proposal_reference.
end note

legend bottom
  Persisted statuses come from PendingSubmissionStatus:
  PENDING_CONFIRMATION and CONFIRMED.

  INVALID, EXPIRED, and ALREADY_CONFIRMED are API confirmation outcomes,
  not stored enum values on PendingPublicSubmission.
endlegend

@enduml
